{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind and let your imagination flourish in <strong>Dreaming Diorama</strong> \u2014 a cozy, casual puzzle game where you build enchanting miniature worlds, one piece at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Meets Art</strong> \u2013 Each diorama is a delightful challenge, crafted from intricate pieces waiting to be assembled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> \u2013 Build from any angle, any location. Your strategy is entirely your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No timers, no pressure. Just a relaxing experience at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive 3D Exploration</strong> \u2013 Dive into beautifully rendered environments and bring your tiny worlds to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a puzzle enthusiast or simply enjoy cozy games, <strong>Dreaming Diorama</strong> offers the perfect escape. Ready to create something beautiful? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/ecedd2c165c35fa672f3cda1e4667963.avif?t=1757351088\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each diorama is centered around a unique theme \u2014 some calm, others lively \u2014 offering a variety of moods and atmospheres. As players assemble each scene piece by piece, they contribute to a larger, cohesive experience that unfolds throughout the game. Designed to be both soothing and creatively fulfilling, the game leaves players with a sense of accomplishment upon completion. Whether you love solving puzzles or just enjoy building beautiful things, this game aims to offer a meaningful and enjoyable journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/c31971efee59fe33fcfd79c716acdced.avif?t=1757351088\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/1d818880922cecf6a161a549b1a1474ff587a6d7.jpg"},{"name":"Proficient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/2ae70291b9aca8dc38d45d799698ca25c98f39ec.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/0750cb76e5bcd75390c707046c7575d175e2221b.jpg"},{"name":"Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/997c07409a0c91ec90ad922dba39e0520863b031.jpg"},{"name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/970872a22b3da6a6943f229a521ca31fed33307b.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/093c781581558d788cb3303d25cdf1888029269c.jpg"},{"name":"Determined","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/0ac5dd94745d20f17f931d4747f6c089c546fce8.jpg"},{"name":"Genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2460640/3226509b358d4b9a34bf449add6971be004d1250.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2460640?t=1757351088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2460640?t=1757351088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757351088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17573510